[{"client_msg_id":"2dd702db-8881-44d1-b559-a79f395a0a95","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そうですねえ。私は tower-lsp 使ったこと無いのでよくわからないですが、たぶんクレート名変えれば殆ど動く、みたいな感じなんじゃないかなーと思います。\n\nちなみに、 deno lsp は lspower を使っているようです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/tree/main/cli/lsp\u003e","ts":"1624333429.198700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"deno","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wxWkc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D187747E-F833-4C55-A72D-1B16B2BCF5D6","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"\u003chttp://docs.rs|docs.rs\u003eでぱっと見APIが同じで気になってました。何となくですが、乗り換えも簡単そうですね","ts":"1624333222.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6lM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ee4c3ae-542a-4920-830d-f14e76d24697","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実は、私もそのあたりよくわからないんですよね。\n私が SATySFi language server の開発を始めた頃は「lspower は tower-lsp の開発が止まっていそうだということでフォークされた新たな crate」という感じだったので、メンテが続いていそうな lspower を選択しました。\nしかし今 tower-lsp を見てみると、最近またメンテナの方が更新してる様子が見られるんですよね…","ts":"1624332900.195900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"manabishika","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xZSYc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A2697B65-CDCB-4815-9A39-22ED34195E56","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"lsp-towerとlspowerはどちらがおすすめですか？","ts":"1624332674.193700","edited":{"user":"U012MBD7MFZ","ts":"1624332685.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ww65"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4BBE24BF-F9D8-4BCF-AC94-09E99A3F5660","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"非同期が分からないので助かります","ts":"1624332671.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GLyU8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"933c70e9-a9ad-4b0e-867e-cccbf492216f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"はい、 `lspower` という crate を使っていて、 LanguageServer トレイトを実装することで言語サーバになる感じです。\nI/F に気を使わなくとも予め定義された構造体に沿ってデータを入れて送受信すればよいので、本質的なロジックに集中できるところがいいですね","ts":"1624332643.192800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gat"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14D680F5-EF75-4595-B880-57B2B5DA040A","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"traitを実装するだけで言語サーバになるのですか？　(たぶん……)","ts":"1624332312.186800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8V3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24f6123d-4ade-498a-a883-28afbfda12e8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ちなみに今週の土曜日、その language server について20分ぐらいお話させてもらう予定です。","ts":"1624332069.185100","thread_ts":"1624332069.185100","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1624332083.000000"},"reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"+1smile","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1RAW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee66ebb9-67cd-4340-8d56-28986054ce45","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"お、まさに今私が作ってるやつですね。\nRust は language server 作りやすくておすすめですよ。（他の言語で作ったことはないですが）","ts":"1624331856.184700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y=hZJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06AE42C4-8222-4A5B-8E79-AB337A8226E8","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"最初はreparseと言わず、保存の度にビルド・エラー表示してくれるだけでも十分かも","ts":"1624326794.183000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y10ay"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81D53FD9-DC04-4DA6-85A7-78B4200F722A","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"かっちょいい!!\n\u003chttps://github.com/monaqa/satysfi-language-server|https://github.com/monaqa/satysfi-language-server\u003e","ts":"1624326610.180800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"monaqa/satysfi-language-server","id":1,"title":"monaqa/satysfi-language-server","text":"The SATySFi Language Server","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"16","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Rust","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":4,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01BY3SDBRS","UKHUVMBJR","U022J550WMQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1I/Y"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01QD3YAUMP","text":"\u003c@U01QD3YAUMP\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624325548.180300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"b97376fc-4c25-48e4-bbfc-d57ab4567dc4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際 language server 作る用途だとたいてい AST では不十分ですね。診断情報や gotoDefinition などの機能では必須ですから。\n私もトークンの位置を保持した木を作ったりしてます。\n文法エラーがあるときに木にできるかどうか、はそのパーサのエラー回復機構の柔軟性によりそうですね…","ts":"1624317424.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ","U022J550WMQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B83F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3883299-6cbf-4cf1-a8b9-da665c6df3af","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"LSP を実装して動かしてみたい :expressionless:","ts":"1624314993.176200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5uduw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0f79bbc-0ce3-4a41-afd2-a3adae6d12de","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"パーサはパーサでも CST へのパーサがあると最近知りました。\nCST は文字列のツリーなので、文法的なエラーがある場合もとにかく木にできるのがエラー報告に良さそうです (ブロックが閉じていないとか、リスト要素の `,` が抜けているとか)","ts":"1624314834.175300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lnE+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d025bbc4-7